WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:06.006
All right, go for it.

00:00:06.965 --> 00:00:11.011
First up at third base,
Magic-User Frankenstein.

00:00:14.472 --> 00:00:15.807
M-Matsumura?

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:20.228
Pretty neat, huh? I made him using
the meat left over from that Door.

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:22.230
Play ball!

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:25.233
Why is Matsumura here?

00:00:25.942 --> 00:00:28.069
Hey, you all right, junior?

00:00:29.154 --> 00:00:30.113
He...

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:36.244
That crazy Kasukabe made him
using parts from a Sorcerer's corpse.

00:00:36.661 --> 00:00:41.249
But it's not against the rules,
and it is a Sorcerer. Let them have it.

00:00:41.332 --> 00:00:42.292
Hurry up and pitch.

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:49.382
How dare you Hole-dwellers
mess with my best friend's body!

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:52.761
Wait, that's it!

00:00:53.303 --> 00:00:57.640
If I take that body home,
Kikurage can revive Matsumura!

00:00:58.099 --> 00:00:59.017
Hurry it up!

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:01.895
Dang, I'm so smart.

00:01:04.522 --> 00:01:06.524
All right, score!

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:10.111
Matsumura!

00:01:11.821 --> 00:01:13.531
Hurry, pull him out!

00:01:15.992 --> 00:01:18.119
Be careful, jeez.

00:01:18.203 --> 00:01:19.996
You're a great guy.

00:01:20.997 --> 00:01:24.000
Second up, at second base: Kasukabe.

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:24.918
All righty.

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:29.631
So Mr. Caiman,
what's the deal with you and Nikaido?

00:01:29.714 --> 00:01:31.925
The deal? We're friends.

00:01:32.008 --> 00:01:36.429
That means I can have her, right?

00:01:38.223 --> 00:01:39.933
Hm. That's none of my business.

00:01:41.893 --> 00:01:42.727
Safe!

00:01:42.977 --> 00:01:44.145
Nice bunt!

00:01:44.229 --> 00:01:46.898
That guy sure is quick on his feet.

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:50.276
Third up, shortstop, Thirteen.

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:55.907
A hit to the right!

00:01:56.282 --> 00:02:00.161
What a useless pitcher. Time for Plan A.

00:02:00.245 --> 00:02:01.663
Plan A?

00:02:02.038 --> 00:02:05.583
Fourth up, catcher. Caiman.

00:02:08.086 --> 00:02:10.046
We meet again, lizard guy.

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:15.593
I was going to destroy him, but I'd better
focus on taking Matsumura back instead.

00:02:15.677 --> 00:02:18.138
Thirteen, that little prick.

00:02:18.721 --> 00:02:19.764
At least...

00:02:19.848 --> 00:02:21.266
I don't know why...

00:02:21.349 --> 00:02:23.434
...I'll strike you out!

00:02:23.518 --> 00:02:25.478
...but he annoys the crap out of me!

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:29.023
All right, three runs!

00:02:29.107 --> 00:02:30.233
Shocking!

00:02:31.109 --> 00:02:33.319
Look at their long faces.

00:02:33.403 --> 00:02:34.362
Atta boy!

00:02:34.445 --> 00:02:36.614
I'm such a loser.

00:02:37.115 --> 00:02:37.991
Fujita.

00:02:38.074 --> 00:02:41.619
What, you came to make fun of me?

00:02:42.704 --> 00:02:44.330
Just use your Magic.

00:02:46.791 --> 00:02:49.377
-Fifth, at first base: Vaux.
-Let's keep it coming.

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:52.380
Strike! You're out!

00:02:53.047 --> 00:02:56.134
What the heck was that?
It was at least 160 km per hour.

00:02:58.094 --> 00:03:01.472
My Magic spurts smoke like a bullet.

00:03:01.556 --> 00:03:04.893
It's weak and limited,
so it's hardly ever useful.

00:03:05.393 --> 00:03:08.897
But I can throw really fast balls
using my smoke.

